          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "readme",
            "text": "cw-protocol is the shared vocabulary of the computerworld simulator. Every service, machine and client speaks in these types: HttpRequest and HttpResponse, the native Page tree a service renders, PageAction for what a click does, and SimError. Everything is serde-serialisable and validated; a Page that names two elements the same is rejected before it is served."
