            "text": "cw_protocol::action — what a click or submit does"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "m-3",
            "text": "cw_protocol::error — SimError and Result"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "m-4",
            "text": "cw_protocol::style — per-element presentation"
