          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "readme",
            "text": "tinyjson-rs parses JSON into a Value enum and serialises it canonically, with object keys sorted and floats in shortest round-trip form, so that a hash of the output means something. It is a few hundred lines with no dependencies, and it is not a replacement for serde_json when you have structs to map."
